st rests on fundamentals and expert ratings.", "Open seat: Kevin Stitt (R) is not on the ballot."]}, "overview": "Oklahoma's governorship is open this year with Kevin Stitt term-limited, leaving Republican Mike Mazzei facing Democrat Cyndi Munson in a state that has leaned heavily Republican in recent cycles. No public general-election polling is available, so the picture rests on the state's partisan fundamentals, expert ratings, and prediction markets, all of which point clearly toward the Republican.\n\nSeven expert raters call the race Safe or Solid R, with two at Likely R, and markets give Munson roughly a 7-8% chance. The candidates met in a single televised debate where tax policy, abortion, and a proposed smelter drew contrasts, and the DGA praised Munson's performance, but no evidence suggests the race is competitive. The forecast expects a Republican win by a double-digit margin, with meaningful uncertainty from the lack of polling.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.0232, "margin": -13.12}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.0251, "margin": -14.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.0363, "margin": -12.5}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.0381, "margin": -12.5}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.035, "margin": -13.0}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.0321, "margin": -13.0}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.0186, "margin": -14.0}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.018, "margin": -14.0}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.0192, "margin": -14.0}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.0194, "margin": -14.0}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.0356, "margin": -12.5}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.0365, "margin": -12.5}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.0342, "margin": -12.5}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_dem": 0.0558, "margin": -11.5}, {"date": "2026-10-06", "p_dem": 0.0353, "margin": -12.5}, {"date": "2026-10-07", "p_dem": 0.0312, "margin": -12.5}, {"date": "2026-10-08", "p_dem": 0.0348, "margin": -12.0}, {"date": "2026-10-09", "p_dem": 0.03, "margi